<li><a href="https://www.at-school-portal.com/moodle/pluginfile.php/293/mod_resource/content/6/Hotel%201-on-1%20Lesson%20Preparation%20Week%201%20Session%202%20-%20Student.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">セッション2の1対1レッスン準備ガイドを学習する</a></li>
